"slotA":"Red#1","slotB":"W4"},{"game":9,"round":"Semifinal","teamA":"Brainerd Bergs","teamB":"Muck Fichigan","scoreA":1,"scoreB":0,"winner":"Brainerd Bergs","slotA":"W5","slotB":"W6"},{"game":10,"round":"Semifinal","teamA":"Hawkeyes","teamB":"Smug Champs","scoreA":1,"scoreB":0,"winner":"Hawkeyes","slotA":"W7","slotB":"W8"},{"game":11,"round":"Final","teamA":"Brainerd Bergs","teamB":"Hawkeyes","scoreA":1,"scoreB":0,"winner":"Brainerd Bergs","slotA":"W9","slotB":"W10"}],"bracketSeeded":true,"ticker":["WELCOME TO THE 2022 B.B.G.C. \u2014 Four groups, six teams per group (five in Orange). Three from each group advance to the knockout round.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 BLUE \u2014 Royale w/ Cheese went through it without a scratch: 5-0, the only perfect record in the tournament. The Seekers took second at 4-1 and Mickey the Mitcher edged in at 2-2-1. Banana in the Tailpipe never got off the mark. ROYALE W/ CHEESE, THE SEEKERS and MICKEY THE MITCHER advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 RED \u2014 Smug Champs, the defending champions, looked every bit of it at 4-1. Behind them a genuine traffic jam: Brothers Boor and Brainerd Bergs both 2-2-1, with Laces Out, Guns n Rollers and Top Gun all at 2-3. Fine margins everywhere. SMUG CHAMPS, BROTHERS BOOR and BRAINERD BERGS advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 YELLOW \u2014 The Hawkeyes did not lose a game: 4-0-1, the only unbeaten card in the group stage. White Zin were right there at 3-1-1. Vandelay Industries Industries took the last ticket. HAWKEYES, WHITE ZIN and VANDELAY INDUSTRIES INDUSTRIES advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 ORANGE \u2014 Five teams, four games each. Muck Fichigan came out on top at 3-1, and then a straight tie for second: The Big LeBocce and Be-Yotch-e, Please, both 2-2. Sparty Devils and Billy G.O.A.T. both 1-2-1. MUCK FICHIGAN, BIG LeBOCCE and BE-YOTCH-E, PLEASE advance.","ROUND ONE \u2014 Brainerd Bergs edged out Mickey the Mitcher. The Seekers ended Vandelay Industries Industries. The Big LeBocce upset Brothers Boor. And Be-Yotch-e, Please sent WHITE ZIN home in the first game they played. The eleven seed over the six.","QUARTERFINALS \u2014 Hawkeyes held firm over The Big LeBocce, Smug Champs saw off Be-Yotch-e, and Muck Fichigan ended The Seekers. But the shock of the day came at the top of the board: BRAINERD BERGS TOOK DOWN ROYALE W/ CHEESE. Five and oh in the group, number one seed, out in a single game.","SEMIFINALS \u2014 Brainerd Bergs weren't done \u2014 they ended Muck Fichigan too. And the Hawkeyes stopped the defending champion Smug Champs cold. An eight seed and a two seed for the trophy.","THE FINAL \u2014 Hawkeyes: 4-0-1, the group stage's only unbeaten team, 2018 champions chasing a second. Brainerd Bergs: eighth seed out of a logjammed Red group, and a bracket run that had already buried the number one seed and a group champion.","\ud83c\udfc6 CHAMPIONS: BRAINERD BERGS \ud83c\udfc6 \u2014 They came in eighth. They beat the top seed, they beat a group champion, and then they beat the only team that hadn't lost all day. The Hawkeyes' second title will have to wait. 2022 goes to the Brainerd Bergs."],"year":2022,"years":[2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026]}